#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/tutorials/source-sdk.md:9
msgid "Build an independent Source SDK consumer"
msgstr "构建独立的 Source SDK 消费工程"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/tutorials/source-sdk.md:11
msgid ""
"Start a real external C11 application from a reviewed template, then build "
"and run its Native model. This path needs Linux, Python 3.11+, CMake 3.31+, "
"Ninja, a C compiler and Git. The product owns its assembly and application "
"sources; Nexus owns reusable mechanisms. No MCU is flashed by this tutorial."
msgstr ""
"从经过复核的模板创建真实外部 C11 应用，再构建并运行 Native 模型。此路径需要 Linux、Python 3.11+、CMake "
"3.31+、Ninja、C 编译器与 Git。产品拥有装配和应用源码；Nexus 拥有可复用机制。本教程不烧录 MCU。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/tutorials/source-sdk.md:16
msgid "Create and run an application"
msgstr "创建并运行应用"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/tutorials/source-sdk.md:18
msgid ""
"Obtain a verified Source SDK and the external [nexus-"
"examples](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus-examples) checkout. Set "
"`NEXUS_SDK_PREFIX` to the installed SDK prefix, `NEXUS_EXAMPLES_DIR` to that"
" checkout and `NEXUS_EXAMPLES_REVISION` to the exact 40-character examples "
"commit recorded with the chosen platform delivery. These are separate "
"identities: the template's expected platform revision does not prove which "
"SDK was used. Run these commands from `$NEXUS_SDK_PREFIX/share/nexus/src`; "
"choose a new product directory outside both input checkouts:"
msgstr ""
"取得已验证的 Source SDK 和外部 [nexus-examples](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus-"
"examples) 检出。将 `NEXUS_SDK_PREFIX` 设为已安装 SDK 的前缀，`NEXUS_EXAMPLES_DIR` "
"设为示例检出，`NEXUS_EXAMPLES_REVISION` 设为所选平台交付记录关联的完整40 "
"位示例提交。这些身份分开记录：模板预期的平台版本不能证明实际使用了哪个 SDK。从 "
"`$NEXUS_SDK_PREFIX/share/nexus/src` 执行下列命令；在两个输入检出之外选择新的产品目录："

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/tutorials/source-sdk.md:38
msgid ""
"Creation reads committed template blobs and their SHA-256 manifest without "
"network access. It rejects a different Git HEAD, changed template bytes, a "
"symlink or an existing destination. It resolves the copied assembly before "
"success; failure removes only its newly created destination. Inspect "
"`.nexus-template.json`: `expected_platform` is the template's lock "
"expectation; `validation` records the resolver and input bytes actually "
"checked."
msgstr ""
"创建过程读取已提交的模板 blob 与其 SHA-256 manifest，不访问网络。不同 Git HEAD、变化的模板字节、symlink "
"或已有目标目录都会被拒绝。成功前先解析复制后的装配；失败只删除其新创建的目标。检查 `.nexus-"
"template.json`：`expected_platform` 是模板源码锁中的预期；`validation` 记录实际检查的解析器与输入字节。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/tutorials/source-sdk.md:45
msgid ""
"The generated product contains `CMakeLists.txt`, `assembly.toml`, `main.c` "
"and `README.md`. A successful Native test prints `Nexus starter: transfer "
"settled; platform stopped` and exits zero. Native UART is a software model, "
"not a host serial port. The example uses strong factory references, provides"
" request storage, observes settlement and stops the platform. A timeout is "
"an error, not permission to release outstanding storage."
msgstr ""
"生成的产品包含 `CMakeLists.txt`、`assembly.toml`、`main.c` 与 `README.md`。Native "
"测试成功会输出 `Nexus starter: transfer settled; platform stopped` 并以零退出。Native "
"UART 是软件模型，不是 host 串口。示例使用 strong factory 引用，提供请求存储，观察结清并停止平台。timeout "
"是错误，不能授权释放未结清存储。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/tutorials/source-sdk.md:52
msgid ""
"For a development checkout instead of an installed SDK, replace `Nexus_DIR` "
"with `-DNEXUS_SOURCE=/absolute/path/to/nexus`. This exercises that checkout "
"and does not qualify an SDK. Select `qiming`, `sky` or `liangshan` for the "
"maintained MCU template. SDK consumers add "
"`-DCMAKE_TOOLCHAIN_FILE=\"$NEXUS_SDK_PREFIX/share/nexus/src/cmake/toolchains/arm-"
"gcc.cmake\"`; checkout consumers instead select "
"`-DCMAKE_TOOLCHAIN_FILE=/absolute/path/to/nexus/cmake/toolchains/arm-"
"gcc.cmake`. Use the locked ARM compiler. An MCU link is software evidence; "
"board bring-up and electrical verification remain separate."
msgstr ""
"使用开发检出而非已安装 SDK 时，将 `Nexus_DIR` 替换为 "
"`-DNEXUS_SOURCE=/absolute/path/to/nexus`。这仅验证该检出，不建立 SDK 资格。已维护的 MCU 模板选择 "
"`qiming`、`sky` 或 `liangshan`。SDK 消费方增加 "
"`-DCMAKE_TOOLCHAIN_FILE=\"$NEXUS_SDK_PREFIX/share/nexus/src/cmake/toolchains/arm-"
"gcc.cmake\"`；源码检出消费方则选择 "
"`-DCMAKE_TOOLCHAIN_FILE=/absolute/path/to/nexus/cmake/toolchains/arm-"
"gcc.cmake`。使用锁定的 ARM 编译器。MCU 链接属于软件证据；板卡启动和电气验证仍单独进行。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/tutorials/source-sdk.md:62
msgid ""
"If creation rejects configuration, read the reported file, key and "
"constraint. Check the selected SDK/interface and fixed template revision "
"first. A template correction requires a newly reviewed commit, not edits to "
"pinned template bytes. After successful creation, edit the product's "
"authored assembly and configure again; use the [configuration and ownership "
"guide](../guides/developer-workflow.md) to inspect reviewed bindings. Do not"
" repair generated files or suppress a rejected selection. Keep product "
"sources; remove only your own build output after retaining needed logs."
msgstr ""
"创建因配置被拒绝时，阅读报告中的文件、key 与约束。先检查所选 "
"SDK／接口和固定模板版本。模板修正需要新的已复核提交，不能修改固定模板字节。成功创建后，编辑产品 authored "
"装配并重新配置；通过[配置与所有权指南](../guides/developer-workflow.md)检查已复核 "
"binding。不要修补生成文件或压制拒绝。保留产品源码；保存必要日志后只删除自有构建输出。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/tutorials/source-sdk.md:71
msgid "Maintainer: verify the complete SDK consumer"
msgstr "维护者：验证完整 SDK 消费"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/tutorials/source-sdk.md:73
msgid ""
"To verify the examples repository itself, use its maintained "
"`scripts/local_ci.py` and bilingual `docs/local-ci.md` at the fixed examples"
" revision. The default scope runs the complete mapped local workflow from a "
"new output directory; `--scope native`, `--scope arm` and preset selection "
"remain partial scopes. Its explicit `--nexus-source` must match the examples"
" lock. An optional `--installed-sdk` must match the same pin. This workflow "
"does not turn a blocked hosted CI run into a passed one, nor establish "
"physical HIL."
msgstr ""
"验证示例仓库本身时，使用固定示例版本中的维护入口 `scripts/local_ci.py` 和双语 `docs/local-ci.md`。默认 "
"scope 从新输出目录执行完整映射的本地工作流；`--scope native`、`--scope arm` 和 preset 选择仍是局部范围。显式"
" `--nexus-source` 必须匹配示例锁定版本；可选 `--installed-sdk` 也必须匹配同一版本。该工作流不会把受阻的托管 CI "
"改为通过，也不建立物理 HIL 资格。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/tutorials/source-sdk.md:81
msgid ""
"The remaining sections are platform maintenance tasks. First obtain the "
"[fixed source and recursive dependencies](../guides/source-checkout.md). Run"
" from that checkout, not an arbitrary default branch. The maintained "
"contract below checks independent C and C++ consumption, relocation and "
"package identity."
msgstr ""
"以下各节是平台维护任务。先取得[固定源码与递归依赖](../guides/source-"
"checkout.md)。从该检出执行，不使用任意默认分支。以下已维护合同检查独立 C／C++ 消费、搬移与包身份。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/tutorials/source-sdk.md:86
msgid ""
"Work from the repository root with the pinned recursive dependencies "
"initialized. Keep output outside the source checkout. This exact test calls "
"the production packager and maintained consumer template, moves the prefix "
"into a path containing spaces, configures independent projects, builds both "
"languages and runs the Native executables:"
msgstr ""
"从仓库根目录执行，先初始化锁定的递归依赖。输出置于源码 checkout "
"外。下面这个确切测试调用生产打包器和维护中的消费者模板，将前缀搬移到含空格的路径，配置独立工程，构建两种语言并运行 Native 可执行文件："

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/tutorials/source-sdk.md:96
msgid ""
"Success is a nonempty unittest execution ending in `OK`, with exit code "
"zero. The test's temporary directory is removed automatically. Failure "
"preserves its actual command diagnostic; do not count a missing compiler as "
"a passed consumer. The fixture deliberately packages a development snapshot "
"and explicitly opts in; this validates consumption, not a publishable "
"software candidate."
msgstr ""
"成功要求非空 unittest 执行以 `OK` "
"结束，退出码为零。测试自动清理临时目录。失败保留实际命令诊断；编译器缺失不能记作消费者通过。夹具明确打包开发快照并显式允许消费；这验证消费流程，不建立可发布软件候选。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/tutorials/source-sdk.md:102
msgid ""
"The complete consumer is maintained in the production verifier rather than "
"copied into this page. These literal inputs are the same templates exercised"
" by the test:"
msgstr "完整消费者由生产验证器维护，本页不复制实现。以下真实输入就是该测试执行的模板："

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/tutorials/source-sdk.md:105
msgid ""
"Maintained Native/F407/F470 consumer preparation; template code is not a "
"shell command."
msgstr "维护中的 Native/F407/F470 消费者准备；模板代码不是 shell 命令。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/tutorials/source-sdk.md:112
msgid "Maintainer: prepare a publishable prefix"
msgstr "维护者：准备可发布前缀"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/tutorials/source-sdk.md:114
msgid ""
"From an initialized, clean, committed checkout, choose a new owned output "
"path:"
msgstr "从已初始化、干净且已提交的 checkout 开始，选择自己拥有的新输出路径："

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/tutorials/source-sdk.md:121
msgid ""
"Move the entire prefix, including its identity and licenses, before "
"consumption. The [Source SDK contract](../design/source-compatibility.md) "
"defines version and interface epoch checks. Missing, extra, modified or "
"symlinked payload files reject configuration. A package made with "
"`--development-fixture` remains nonpublishable and requires "
"`NEXUS_ALLOW_SOURCE_SDK_FIXTURE=ON` in its consumer. Never use that opt-in "
"to bypass release qualification."
msgstr ""
"消费前搬移整个前缀，包括身份和许可。[Source SDK 合同](../design/source-compatibility.md)定义版本与接口 "
"epoch 检查。内容文件缺失、额外、修改或符号链接文件会拒绝配置。使用 `--development-fixture` "
"生成的包保持不可发布，消费者必须显式设置 `NEXUS_ALLOW_SOURCE_SDK_FIXTURE=ON`。不得用该选项绕过发布资格。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/tutorials/source-sdk.md:128
msgid ""
"The formal installed-prefix verifier requires the locked ARM compiler on "
"`PATH` in addition to host tools. It builds Native C/C++ and the maintained "
"MCU consumers:"
msgstr ""
"正式安装前缀验证器除主机工具外，还要求锁定的 ARM 编译器位于 `PATH`。它构建 Native C/C++ 和维护中的 MCU 消费者："

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/tutorials/source-sdk.md:135
msgid ""
"Check `verification.json`, every recorded exit code, Native runtime results,"
" MCU ELF/BIN/map and resource reports. MCU linking does not execute "
"hardware. The verifier's output is owned; an unrelated existing directory "
"rejects replacement. The SDK prefix and output must be canonical paths "
"without symlink aliases, and neither may contain the other. A rejected path "
"leaves SDK bytes and previous reports untouched; read the failure diagnostic"
" on stderr. An admitted owned output is cleared before the next attempt. "
"Remove only outputs you created after retaining required evidence."
msgstr ""
"检查 `verification.json`、每个记录的退出码、Native 运行结果、MCU ELF/BIN/map 与资源报告。MCU "
"链接不执行硬件。验证器输出为专有目录；不相关的已有目录会拒绝替换。SDK "
"前缀与输出必须是没有符号链接别名的规范路径，且两者均不得包含另一方。路径被拒绝时，SDK 字节和既有报告保持不变；失败诊断写入 "
"stderr。通过准入的专有输出会在下一次尝试前清空。仅在保留所需证据后删除自己创建的输出。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/tutorials/source-sdk.md:144
msgid "Choose a product assembly"
msgstr "选择产品装配"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/tutorials/source-sdk.md:146
msgid ""
"Products keep `assembly.toml`, `main`, workers and private Board data in an "
"external repository. They consume `Nexus::Platform` through "
"`nexus_add_firmware()`; the helper does not generate an application or start"
" a scheduler. Use the [assembly "
"reference](../reference/configuration/assembly.md) to select reviewed "
"bindings and the [factory explanation](../explanation/factory.md) to obtain "
"faces. Public product examples live in [nexus-"
"examples](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus-examples)."
msgstr ""
"产品在外部仓库维护 `assembly.toml`、`main`、执行任务和私有 Board 数据。通过 `nexus_add_firmware()` "
"消费 "
"`Nexus::Platform`；该辅助函数不生成应用或启动调度器。使用[装配参考](../reference/configuration/assembly.md)选择复核绑定，通过[factory"
" 说明](../explanation/factory.md)取得接口面。公开产品示例位于 [nexus-"
"examples](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus-examples)。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/tutorials/source-sdk.md:154
msgid ""
"![Source SDK preparation, relocation and independent consumer "
"verification](../assets/diagrams/source-sdk-consumer.svg)"
msgstr ""
"![Source SDK 准备、搬移与独立消费者验证](../assets/diagrams/source-sdk-consumer.svg)"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/tutorials/source-sdk.md:154
msgid ""
"Source SDK preparation, relocation and independent consumer verification"
msgstr "Source SDK 准备、搬移与独立消费者验证"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/tutorials/source-sdk.md:156
msgid ""
"FIG-10 shows the current software consumption flow. Runtime and MCU link "
"evidence remain separate from [physical "
"qualification](../reference/platforms/qualification.md)."
msgstr ""
"FIG-10 表示当前软件消费流程。Runtime 与 MCU "
"链接证据和[物理资格](../reference/platforms/qualification.md)分别记录。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/tutorials/source-sdk.md:159
msgid "Maintainer: recover delivery without moving an existing tag"
msgstr "维护者：恢复交付且不移动已有 tag"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/tutorials/source-sdk.md:161
msgid ""
"Release maintainers normally use the same commit for SDK source and the "
"delivery workflow. If only delivery tooling needs repair after the source "
"has been tagged, keep that tag fixed. The `recover_tagged_source` input "
"defaults to `false`; only an explicit recovery with `publish=true` allows "
"the tagged source and the current `main` workflow builder to differ. Same-"
"source runs do not require `builder_ci_run_id`."
msgstr ""
"发布维护者通常对 SDK "
"源码和交付工作流使用同一提交。源码建立标签后，若仅需修复交付工具，必须保持该标签不变。`recover_tagged_source` 输入默认为 "
"`false`；只有显式选择恢复并设置 `publish=true`，才允许已标签源码与当前 `main` 工作流构建器使用不同提交。同源运行无需 "
"`builder_ci_run_id`。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/tutorials/source-sdk.md:168
msgid ""
"Before recovery, open this repository's **Settings → Secrets and variables →"
" Actions → New repository secret** and create `NEXUS_RELEASE_TOKEN`. Use an "
"approved credential restricted to this repository with Actions read, "
"Contents write and Workflows write permissions. See the [publishing "
"contract](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/tools/release/README.md#publishing-credentials) for token types, "
"expiry and approval. Enter the value only in GitHub's secret field; never "
"send it in chat. Connecting GitHub to the assistant does not create this "
"Actions secret."
msgstr ""
"恢复前，打开该仓库的 **Settings → Secrets and variables → Actions → New repository "
"secret**，创建 `NEXUS_RELEASE_TOKEN`。使用经批准且仅限本仓库的凭据，授予 Actions 读、Contents 写和 "
"Workflows 写权限。凭据类型、有效期和批准要求见[发布合同](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/tools/release/README.md#publishing-credentials)。仅在 GitHub 的 secret "
"输入框填写凭据值；不得通过聊天发送。将 GitHub 连接到助手并不会创建该 Actions secret。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/tutorials/source-sdk.md:177
msgid ""
"Recovery rejects a missing secret before SDK work. This check proves only "
"that the secret is configured, not that its permissions, approval or expiry "
"are valid. Only the final recovery publication step uses it; SDK "
"preparation, downloads and attestation retain the built-in workflow "
"credentials. An ordinary publication from one source and builder commit "
"always uses the built-in token."
msgstr ""
"恢复流程在 SDK 工作前拒绝缺少 secret 的运行。此检查仅证明 secret "
"已配置，不能证明其权限、批准状态或有效期符合要求。仅恢复流程的最终发布步骤使用该凭据；SDK "
"准备、下载与证明继续使用内置工作流凭据。源码与构建器使用同一提交的普通发布始终使用内置 token。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/tutorials/source-sdk.md:183
msgid ""
"From the repository root, use an authenticated GitHub CLI with Actions write"
" permission. Set `NEXUS_RELEASE_SOURCE` to the tagged 40-character source "
"commit. Set `NEXUS_CI_RUN_ID` to its successful full CI run on `main` and "
"`NEXUS_BUILDER_CI_RUN_ID` to the successful full CI run for the current "
"`main` builder. Both runs must have been created within the last 24 hours; "
"source CI cannot qualify a different builder. After each delivery-tool "
"repair, select the new builder's CI run, keeping the source commit and tag "
"unchanged. Then dispatch:"
msgstr ""
"从仓库根目录操作，使用已认证且具备 Actions 写权限的 GitHub CLI。将 `NEXUS_RELEASE_SOURCE` 设为已标签的 40"
" 字符源码提交，将 `NEXUS_CI_RUN_ID` 设为在 `main` 上针对该源码成功执行的完整 CI 运行编号，将 "
"`NEXUS_BUILDER_CI_RUN_ID` 设为当前 `main` 构建器成功执行的完整 CI 运行编号。两次运行均须在过去 24 "
"小时内创建；源码 CI 不能为不同的构建器建立资格。每次修复交付工具后，选择新构建器的 CI 运行，保持源码提交与标签不变。然后触发工作流："

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/tutorials/source-sdk.md:199
msgid ""
"The workflow derives the builder from its actual `main` workflow and "
"checkout. Recovery requires identical source and builder version-policy "
"bytes, the existing tag pointing to the source, and the live `main` "
"reference pointing to the builder. The SDK, documentation and source CI "
"retain the tagged source identity; the delivery receipt records the builder "
"separately. Policy mismatches reject admission, and both references are "
"checked before and after asset uploads."
msgstr ""
"工作流根据实际 `main` 工作流与 checkout 确定构建器。恢复要求源码与构建器的版本策略字节完全相同、既有标签指向该源码、实时 `main`"
" 引用指向该构建器。SDK、文档和源码 CI 保持已标签源码的身份，交付记录另行标明构建器。策略不一致时拒绝准入；资产上传前后均复核这两个引用。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/tutorials/source-sdk.md:207
msgid ""
"Keep every original evidence file when repairing packaging limits. Do not "
"move the tag, omit evidence or substitute a different source CI run to "
"obtain success. A dispatch alone does not establish publication: inspect the"
" completed workflow, release manifest and assets, then independently "
"download and verify the SDK. Recovery does not establish physical HIL or "
"production qualification."
msgstr ""
"修复打包限制时保留全部原始证据文件。不得为了获得成功而移动标签、删去证据或换用不同源码的 CI "
"运行。仅触发工作流不能证明已发布：必须检查完成的工作流、发布清单与资产，再独立下载并验证 SDK。恢复不建立物理 HIL 或生产资格。"
